{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25428","headline":"忆平泉山居赠沈吏部一首 · 李德裕","name":"忆平泉山居赠沈吏部一首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔闻羊叔子，茅屋在东渠。\n岂不念归路，徘徊畏简书。\n乃知轩冕客，自与田园疎。\n殁世有遗恨，精诚何所如。\n嗟予寡时用，夙志在林闾。\n虽抱山水癖，敢希仁智居。\n清泉绕舍下，修竹荫庭除。\n幽径松盖密，小池莲叶初。\n从来有好鸟，近复跃鯈鱼。\n少室映川陆，鸣臯对蓬庐。\n张何旧寮寀，相勉在悬舆。\n常恐似伯玉，瞻前慙魏舒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25428.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25428","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}